 # TouchDesigner Integration (twozero MCP)
 
+## When to Use
+
+- Building real-time generative visuals or VJ setups in TouchDesigner
+- Creating audio-reactive shaders and GLSL effects
+- Automating TouchDesigner operator creation and parameter setting via MCP
+- Projection mapping, multi-window output, or installation art
+- Needing to discover TD operator parameters programmatically (avoid guessing)
+- Building feedback loops, particle systems, or 3D scenes in TD
+- Recording TD output to video (ProRes/MJPEG) via MovieFileOut
+- Connecting external data (MIDI, OSC, WebSocket, HTTP) to TD parameters
+
+## Not For
+
+- **Image generation from text prompts** → use `stable-diffusion-image-generation` or `comfyui` instead
+- **3D mathematical animations or equation derivations** → use `manim-video` instead
+- **ASCII or text-based video output** → use `ascii-video` instead
+- **Configuring generic MCP servers** → use `native-mcp` instead
+- **Web scraping or browser automation** → use `agent-browser` or `pinchtab` instead
+- **Building interactive web demos** → use `p5js` instead
+
